# A build from source (Dockerfile, stage source) needs the Go sources alone:
# everything else stays out of the build context. A release builds the
# image from the release archives instead, in a context of its own
# (scripts/release/build-image.sh).
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!internal/
!schemas/
**/*_test.go
**/testdata/
